---
import { site } from '../site.config';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const title = `Privacy Policy | ${site.brand}`;
const description = `How ${site.brand} collects, uses, and stores the information you submit through the quote form or by calling our tracking number.`;

const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
  </div>

  <div class="wrap-narrow prose policy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>
      This policy covers {site.domain}. It is written to be read rather than to be defensible, so
      it is short and specific.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>When you submit the quote form:</strong> your name, phone number, the service you
      selected, anything you typed in the message field, which page you submitted from, and any
      campaign parameters in the URL. We also record the time of submission.</p>
    <p><strong>When you call the number on this site:</strong> that number is a tracking line. We
      record your caller ID, the time and duration of the call, and which page you were on if the
      call came from a click on this site. <strong>Calls may be recorded</strong> for quality and
      accuracy, and you will hear an announcement to that effect at the start of the call.</p>
    <p><strong>When you simply browse:</strong> aggregate, privacy-preserving page analytics with no
      cookies and no cross-site tracking. We do not run Google Analytics, advertising pixels, or
      third-party trackers on this site.</p>

    <h2>What we do with it</h2>
    <p>
      We use your contact information to respond to your request, quote your job, and route it to a
      certified radon professional who can perform the work. That routing is the entire purpose of
      this site, and submitting the form means your information will be shared with the professional
      assigned to your job.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use the page and campaign data to understand which pages produce real inquiries, so we know
      what to write more of.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do not do with it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>We do not sell your information.</strong> Not to data brokers, not to lead
        aggregators, not to anyone.</li>
      <li><strong>We do not share it beyond the professional assigned to your job</strong>, plus the
        service providers listed below who process it on our behalf.</li>
      <li><strong>We do not put you into an automated marketing sequence.</strong> If you do not
        proceed, you stop hearing from us.</li>
      <li><strong>We do not run advertising or retargeting pixels</strong>, so submitting this form
        will not cause radon ads to follow you around the internet.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <p>
      We use a small number of third parties to operate the site. Each of them processes data on our
      behalf under their own terms:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the site, stores form and call records, and provides
        privacy-preserving analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Twilio</strong> provides the tracking phone number and handles call routing and
        recording.</li>
      <li><strong>Resend</strong> delivers the email notification that tells us a form came in.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Inquiry records and call logs are retained while they are useful for serving customers and
      understanding site performance. If you would like your information deleted, email {' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will remove it, including call
      recordings, and confirm when it is done.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Do not want a call recorded?</strong> Say so when you are connected and recording
        for that call will stop, or use the form instead.</li>
      <li><strong>Prefer not to give a phone number?</strong> Email us at {' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> instead. A phone number is on the form
        because a radon quote is genuinely faster by phone, not because we require one to talk.</li>
      <li><strong>Want your data removed?</strong> Ask, and we will do it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is intended for property owners and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly
      collect information from anyone under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes materially, the updated date at the top changes with it. We do not
      backdate revisions.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-0">
      Questions about this policy, or about what we hold on you:{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or call {site.phone.display}.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy {
    padding-block: var(--s-4) var(--s-8);
  }
  .policy h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-3);
  }
  .policy .lead {
    color: var(--muted-text);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-6);
  }
</style>
